+        # high-water mark. An exhausted pane is *static*; movement in either
+        # direction is evidence of activity. If Google ever virtualises and
+        # unmounts off-screen cards, a run of shrinking iterations must keep us
+        # scrolling — `> last` would let three of them exhaust the pane.
